## 🔌 TOOL NAMES ON CURSOR

Commands, agents and rules use the Antigravity tool names on the left. On Cursor use the native tool on the right (full table: `rules/REFERENCE.md`); never call a tool that does not exist here.

| Kit name | Cursor |
|----------|--------|
| `invoke_subagent(...)` / `TypeName: "research"` | built-in subagent / Task tool when available; otherwise run the phases yourself (TIER 2 EMBODY) |
| `send_message(Recipient: …)` (Warm Reuse) | not available: spawn again with the full 5-field packet |
| `Model: "inherit"` / `"flash"` | omit |
| `search_web` / `read_url_content` | `@Web` / web search tool |
| `view_file`, `grep_search`, `write_file`, `run_command` | read file / codebase search, edit file tool, terminal tool |
| `ask_question` | ask in chat |
| Artifacts `<appDataDir>\brain\<conversation-id>\` | `./reports/{topic}/` |

