## 🧠 QUALITY-FIRST MODEL POLICY (USE THE SELECTED MODEL)

- **Default**: subagents run on the model you selected in Cursor; never ask for a weaker model for core engineering, planning, architecture, scouting, debugging, testing, reviewing, security, design, or documentation work.
- **Trivial Chores Only**: keep the same model and a short prompt (renames, formatting, file listings).

